title: Properties are the only thing that needs review for safe sharing.
pid: c5c6350d-5306-45f1-ac55-ef77fa421af0
body: |2-
  Something is safe to share if its properties and (visible) out-links
  are safe to share, even if very private things link to it,
  and even if it out-links to some very private things
  (because by default those relationships are in the very-private thing's skrepo).
